    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45513" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχρηστ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Orph.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			272
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράομαι</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>useful, serviceable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					777b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.8.5
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					5.40
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); of persons, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.153
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ δήμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					102.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii/i B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεῦος εὔ. τῷ δεσπότῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Ti.</u>
					2.21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχρησται ἡμέραι</span>, in
			astrology, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				272
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.334
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. ἔχειν πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.73.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>easy to execute</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διίππευσις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				18.4
			</span></i>.</div>
